cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FlagQC"
abstract: >-
  A quality-control toolkit for microscopy images that flags issues such as
  saturation, crosstalk, bit-depth problems, background non-uniformity, and odd
  histogram distributions.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - bioimaging
  - quality control
  - crosstalk
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancisCrickInstitute/py-bioimage-qc"
